          <code>{HEADLINE.emitMinMib.toFixed(0)} to {HEADLINE.emitMaxMib.toFixed(0)} MiB/s</code>:
          <code>{HEADLINE.emitVsFkyamlMin.toFixed(1)}x to {HEADLINE.emitVsFkyamlMax.toFixed(1)}x</code>
          faster than C++ <code>fkYAML</code>,
          <code>{HEADLINE.emitVsNoyalibMin.toFixed(1)}x to {HEADLINE.emitVsNoyalibMax.toFixed(1)}x</code>
          faster than <code>noyalib</code>, and
          <code>{HEADLINE.emitVsYamlSerdeMin.toFixed(1)}x to {HEADLINE.emitVsYamlSerdeMax.toFixed(1)}x</code>
          faster than <code>yaml-serde</code>.
