        caption={`Left: peak heap scales parallel to the O(n) slope guide across two orders of magnitude. Right: normalized 10x time steps sit at ${scalingTimeMin.toFixed(2)}x to ${scalingTimeMax.toFixed(2)}x and every 100 KiB to 1 MiB peak-heap step settles below 1.00x.`}
